2026-10-24T05:51:19.7134180Z Linux USB/IP device management (experimental preview)
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7134516Z 
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7134640Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7134860Z 
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7134953Z Commands:
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7135432Z   diagnostics         Export bounded private diagnostics without changing or stopping USB devices
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7135945Z   logs                Read sanitized stored logs or authorized agent audit projections
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7136598Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7137376Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7138232Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7138835Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7139343Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7139848Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7140337Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7140839Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7141397Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7141931Z   virtual-server      Serve two virtual test devices; this experimental mode provides no authentication or TLS
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7142439Z   devices             Scan local devices without changing drivers. Discovery is not compatibility validation
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7142905Z   doctor              Read installed tool, module and helper capabilities without loading modules
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7143359Z   discover            Query a server's USB/IP device list over an administrator-managed trusted network
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7143848Z   export              Export an administrator-allowlisted device fingerprint via the privileged helper
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7144291Z   unexport            Release an allowlisted export and request local driver reattachment
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7144696Z   attach              Import a remote bus ID through an allowlisted endpoint and Linux VHCI
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7145063Z   detach              Disconnect an authorized local VHCI port (0..255)
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7145599Z   sessions            Read authoritative native kernel session state through the helper
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7145931Z   status              Query helper and kernel status
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7146223Z   help                Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7146645Z 
2026-10-24T05:51:19.7146722Z Options:
